ges earned. Pokédex: 19 caught. All 8 badges — Victory Road and the Elite Four are next. This is the endgame.', 'party': 'blastoise (L69), lapras (L26), moltres (L50), articuno (L50), abra the kadabra (L19), diglett (L18)', 'goal': {'short': "You're ready — stop grinding and push forward to the next objective", 'medium': 'FIRST HM Fly — a girl in the hidden house on Route 16, just west of Celadon behind a cuttable tree, teaches your team to fly you between towns — the gym comes right after; that errand is the road', 'long': 'Take on the Elite Four'}, 'strategy': "1) WAR PREP: the Elite Four is five fights with NO Center between them — full restores, revives, ethers, and a levelled WHOLE team, or don't walk in.\n2) TEAM BUILD: zapdos (static) — a LEGENDARY upgrade over any raised electric: L50 on capture, out-levels the whole badge-8 curve. Weaken carefully and BALL it — never KO.\n3) DEX PUSH: 19/50 species caught — at 50 the Route 15 aide (by Fuchsia) hands over the EXP. SHARE (the whole bench levels off every fight). Catch every NEW species you cross; never wander just to hunt.\n4) STANDING ORDERS: the goal is ROLL CREDITS. Forward progress beats wandering; heal beats fighting hurt; type advantage decides fights; build the planned team, not just the ace."} options=['battle', 'wander_catch', 'travel:3,25', 'travel:3,24', 'travel:3,26', 'travel:3,22']

